  "description": "Take on the unknown with the GrandTeton-Ultra All-terrain Electric Assist Bicycle. Conquer the trails in Galaxy Silver/Lava Red or Coke Black and experience a new level of adventure. With its powerful motor and versatile design, this bike will push you to your limits!\nKey Features:\n·\nSize Options: One regular size for a personalized and comfortable riding experience.\n·\n·\nA More Natural Ride with Mid-drive and Torque Sensor: The bike is equipped with a robust 500W motor, providing 130Nm powerful support for your rides.\n·\n·\n4-Piston Hydraulic Disc Brake: Tektro 4-piston braking system provides superior stopping power, ensuring your safety amidst any uncertainties even on long trips and at high speeds. Paired with a 203mm adjustable seat tube, it ensures a smoother journey for every rider.\n·\n·\nVanpowers Smart System: Inspired by smart vehicles, Vanpowers' dedicated IoT system offers all the remote safety features you need. Track your bike and maintain control even from a distance, all through your phone.\n·\n·\nLong-Lasting Battery: Equiped with UL certified 710Wh batteries powered by LG cells that last for approximately 80-100 miles range. To ensure 100% safety, each battery uses a Vanpowers BMS (Battery Management System) to optimize heat control.\n·\n·\nAll-terrain fat tires: 26' x 4.0, with double-layer hub design.Gives it versatility, superb grip, whether it's the beach, snow or rugged mountain roads\n·\n·\nAir Suspension Fork: 130 mm Travel Greater adjustability, lighter weight, and relatively simpler maintenance.\n·\n·\nSturdy Build: Weighing at 32kg, the bike offers a solid and stable foundation for your urban adventures.\n·\n·\nSafety Certified: Complies with UL 2849 and CPSC | 16-CFR-2015 standards, ensuring the utmost safety and reliability.\n·\nElevate your commuting experience with the GrandTeton-Ultra. Whether you're navigating city streets or exploring scenic routes, this electric assist bicycle combines style, performance, and safety for an unparalleled riding experience.",
